%% Sprint SPOTIFY-DEEP — Search end-to-end sequence
%% ADR-208 — RF-01 + RF-03 + RF-04
%% Renders: GitHub Mermaid native
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Btn as MiniPlayerBar<br/>Search Button
    participant Dialog as SpotifySearchDialog<br/>(Radix)
    participant Tel as audio-telemetry<br/>(client lib)
    participant Client as spotifyApiClient<br/>(TanStack Query)
    participant Route as audioSpotifyCatalog<br/>handleSpotifySearch
    participant Access as requireSpotifyAccess<br/>(server/services)
    participant Cache as spotifyCatalogCache<br/>(in-memory 5min)
    participant Bucket as spotifyRateLimit<br/>(token bucket 180/min)
    participant Spotify as Spotify Web API<br/>/v1/search

    User->>Btn: click "Buscar Spotify" (or Cmd+/)
    Btn->>Tel: recordActivity("audio.spotify_search_open",<br/>{source, tier, spotifyConnected})
    Note over Tel: ANTES do dialog render —<br/>capture mesmo se render falhar
    Btn->>Dialog: setOpen(true)
    Dialog-->>User: render empty state +<br/>input focused

    User->>Dialog: type "lofi"
    Note over Dialog: debounce 500ms<br/>min 2 chars
    Dialog->>Client: useQuery(['spotify','search','lofi'])

    Client->>Route: GET /api/audio/spotify/search?q=lofi&type=track&limit=20
    Note over Route: Zod parse query<br/>(400 if invalid)

    Route->>Access: requireSpotifyAccess(userId)
    Note over Access: 1. SELECT spotify_tokens row<br/>2. tier check<br/>3. expiresAt check (refresh inline if <60s)<br/>4. product=='premium' check
    Access-->>Route: {accessToken: "BQ..."}

    Route->>Cache: get(`${userId}|search|hash({q,type,limit})`)

    alt Cache HIT (segunda query identica em <5min)
        Cache-->>Route: {tracks: [...]}
        Note over Route: NAO consome bucket
        Route-->>Client: 200 {tracks, cached: true}
    else Cache MISS
        Cache-->>Route: undefined
        Route->>Bucket: consume(userId, 1)

        alt Bucket exhausted (>180/min)
            Bucket-->>Route: {ok: false, retryAfterMs}
            Route-->>Client: 429 {message, retryAfterMs}
            Client-->>Dialog: error state<br/>"Tente em N segundos"
        else Bucket OK
            Bucket-->>Route: {ok: true}
            Route->>Spotify: GET /v1/search?q=lofi&type=track&limit=20&market=from_token<br/>Authorization: Bearer accessToken

            alt Spotify 200
                Spotify-->>Route: {tracks: {items: [raw]}}
                Note over Route: normalize → SpotifyTrack[]<br/>(strip raw fields)<br/>sanitize coverUrl host whitelist
                Route->>Cache: set(key, normalized, ttl=5min)
                Route-->>Client: 200 {tracks, cached: false}
                Client-->>Dialog: render 20 rows<br/>(cover/title/artist/duration/preview/add)
                Dialog-->>User: see results
            else Spotify 401 (token rejected)
                Spotify-->>Route: 401
                Route->>Access: refreshSpotifyAccessToken(userId)
                Access-->>Route: {accessToken: "new..."}
                Note over Route: retry once<br/>(if fail again → 401 client)
            else Spotify 429
                Spotify-->>Route: 429 Retry-After: N
                Note over Route: log "spotify_api_quota_hit"<br/>NAO retenta
                Route-->>Client: 429 {message, retryAfterMs}
            else Spotify 5xx / Network
                Spotify-->>Route: 502 / throw
                Note over Route: console.error<br/>(lesson #9 log antes fallback)
                Route-->>Client: 502 {message: "Spotify indisponivel"}
            end
        end
    end

    User->>Dialog: click track row
    Dialog->>Tel: recordActivity("audio.spotify_track_add",<br/>{trackId, via:'search', immediatePlay:true})
    Dialog->>Dialog: playNow(track)<br/>setOpen(false)
    Note over Dialog: AudioSourceEngine<br/>swap pra SpotifyAudioDriver<br/>(decisao #5 ADR-208)
